    "background_story": "Dr. Vihaan was a renowned archaeologist with a passion for uncovering the secrets of ancient civilizations. His life's work was dedicated to studying the mysterious megaliths that dotted the landscapes of rural England. Vihaan's fascination with these massive stone structures began when he stumbled upon a hidden site in the rolling hills of Cornwall. As he delved deeper into the history of the megaliths, he became convinced that they held the key to understanding the spiritual and cultural practices of the ancient Britons. Vihaan's groundbreaking research and excavations led to a major discovery: a previously unknown megalithic circle, hidden beneath the earth for millennia. His findings sparked a new wave of interest in megalithic studies, cementing his reputation as a leading expert in the field.",
